        },
        {
          "text": "Yavo avaviika zing'anagani ziavo mu vutugi vwavo valavunguluka kuli matu gi misaala mu ing'inga yiligesa, navuzwa valungi valazizagilira kuli matu gimisala mung'inga yumbasu.",
